ghost-role-information-scp-2054-x-name = SCP-2054-X, the Doppelgänger
ghost-role-information-scp-2054-x-description =
    Through an unknown parapsychological process, you formed in the shadows of the complex, copying one of the Foundation staff.
    You are SCP-2054-X, a hostile human anomaly copy whose purpose is to destroy the original person and replace them.
ghost-role-information-scp-2054-x-rules =
    ​[bold]Rules for Playing SCP-2054-X, the Doppelgänger[/bold]
    Your objective is to eliminate the original and replace it. Therefore, you are forbidden from killing witnesses of your elimination of the original if there are three or more of them.
    You are forbidden from hiding the bodies of the killed witnesses in places where no one will find them, such as a closet at an unmanned Security Department post.
objective-issuer-scp-2054-x = A sickened mind dictated
scp-2054-x-role-greeting = Through an unknown parapsychological process, you formed in the shadows of the complex, copying one of the Foundation staff. Your original is still alive. Eliminate them and take their place. Act covertly so nobody notices the substitution.
scp-2054-x-ghost-name-modifier = { $baseName } (SCP-2054-X)
